MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Design ERD for 53 tables across 4 groups (System, HRM, CMS, SCM)
- Add IAuditable interface for soft delete (IsDeleted, UpdatedAt, UpdatedBy, CreatedBy)
- Create 13 new entity classes: LeaveType, JobPosting, Candidate, Training,
  TrainingParticipant, KpiReview, KpiCriteria, Tag, ContentTag, MediaFile,
  SeoMeta, Customer, Unit, Warehouse, Invoice, Payment
- Configure Fluent API: unique indexes, composite PKs, FK relationships,
  global query filter for soft delete
- Add SQL migration script (idempotent) for new tables + audit columns
- Add seed data: 8 roles, 10 departments, 10 positions, 50 employees,
  100 products, 4 warehouses, 20 customers, 7 leave types, 10 units, 8 tags
- Add db/README.md with setup, migration, seed, backup instructions
- Add docs/ERD.md with 4 Mermaid ER diagrams
- Update docs/PROGRESS.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
